{#- The day's tasks input (subconscious/day_tasks.py), a projection of objects: every object shows its label of
    this call (`ref`, day_tasks.project) and its data, never its id. Expects agent_input: day, items [{label, times,
    statement, related: [statement], current: the item's entry on the brain's list {decision, assistant_part, when,
    why, decided_at (UTC ISO), covered_by, relies_on_labels, work}, or None}], own [entry with ref, relies_on_labels,
    work], situation (subconscious/situation.py, rendered by shared/brain/situation.j2; each concern with its plan
    and cancelled entries, day_tasks.with_concerns), matters (each with `ref`),
    earlier (objects an entry relies on that are not otherwise shown), source_labels, correction. Times local. -#}
{%- set A = agent_input -%}
{%- macro item(it) %}
{%- set clock = it.times | reject("equalto", "all day") | list %}
[{{ it.label }}] {% if "all day" in it.times %}All day{% if clock %}, and at {{ clock | join(" and ") }}{% endif %}{% else %}At {{ clock | join(" and ") }}{% endif %}: {{ it.statement }}
{%- for r in it.related %}
    read with: {{ r }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro relied(labels, pad) %}{% if labels %}
{{ pad }}relies on: {% for x in labels %}[{{ x }}]{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endmacro -%}
## Today's calendar ({{ A.day }})

### Not yet on the list (decide each)
{% for it in A["items"] if not it.current %}{{ item(it) }}
{% else %}
(none)
{% endfor %}
### Already on the list (each stays as it is unless the day now needs it changed)
{% for it in A["items"] if it.current %}{{ item(it) }}
    on the list since {{ it.current.decided_at | local_time }}: {% if it.current.decision == "needed" %}needed: {{ it.current.assistant_part }}, {{ it.current.when }}. Why: {{ it.current.why }}{% else %}{{ it.current.decision | replace("_", " ") }}{% if it.current.covered_by %} (covered by [{{ it.current.covered_by }}]){% endif %}: {{ it.current.why }}{% endif %}{{ relied(it.current.relies_on_labels, "    ") }}
{% if it.current.work is defined and it.current.work %}{% with w = it.current.work, pad = "    " %}{% include 'shared/brain/entry_work.j2' %}{% endwith %}{% endif -%}
{% else %}
(none)
{% endfor %}
### Your own entries, and earlier days' entries whose work is still in motion (each stays as it is unless the day now needs it changed)
{% for e in A.own %}- [{{ e.ref }}]{% if e.day != A.day %} (from {{ e.day }}, its work still in motion){% endif %} {{ e.what }} | the assistant: {{ e.assistant_part }} | when: {{ e.when_local }}{% if e.concern_ref %} | serves [{{ e.concern_ref }}]{% endif %} | {{ e.status }}, made {{ e.updated_at | local_time }}: {{ e.why }}{{ relied(e.relies_on_labels, "    ") }}
{% if e.work %}{% with w = e.work, pad = "    " %}{% include 'shared/brain/entry_work.j2' %}{% endwith %}{% endif -%}
{% else %}
(none)
{% endfor %}
{% with s = A.situation %}{% include 'shared/brain/situation.j2' %}{% endwith %}
{% if A.earlier %}
## Earlier things your entries rely on
{% for x in A.earlier -%}
{% if x.missing is defined %}- [{{ x.ref }}] (no longer stored)
{% elif x.kind == "work" %}{% with w = x.work %}{% include 'shared/brain/past_work.j2' %}{% endwith %}
{% elif x.kind in ("message", "reminder") %}- [{{ x.ref }}] [{{ x.at | local_time }}] {{ x.speaker }}: {{ x.text }}
{% elif x.kind == "concern" %}- [{{ x.ref }}] concern: {{ x.title }} ({{ x.bucket }})
{% elif x.kind == "list_entry" %}- [{{ x.ref }}] an entry on the list of {{ x.entry.day or "a concern" }}: {{ x.entry.what }}; {{ x.entry.decision | replace("_", " ") }}{% if x.entry.when_local %}, {{ x.entry.when_local }}{% endif %}; {{ x.entry.status }}, decided {{ x.entry.updated_at | local_time }}
{% elif x.kind == "brain_matter" %}- [{{ x.ref }}] the brain decided at {{ x.at | local_time }}: {% for r in x.reasons %}{{ r }}{% if not loop.last %} / {% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% elif x.gone_from_schedule is defined %}- [{{ x.ref }}] a line no longer on today's schedule
{% endif -%}
{% endfor %}{% endif %}

## What the brain read and decided today
{% for m in A.matters -%}
### [{{ m.ref }}] {{ m.at | local_time }}
{% for e in m.events -%}
- {{ e.source }} at {{ e.at | local_time }}: {{ e.text }}
  the brain: {{ e.decision | replace("_", " ") }}: {{ e.reason }}
{% endfor -%}
{% for n in m.notes -%}
- note on a concern: {{ n.note }}
{% endfor -%}
{% for n in m.new_concerns -%}
- raised a concern: {{ n.title }}
{% endfor %}
{% else -%}
(nothing yet today)
{% endfor %}
{% if A.correction %}
## Your previous answer was refused
{{ A.correction }}
{% endif %}
Decide every item not yet on the list, and an item on the list when the day now needs its entry changed. Decide each
concern planner's proposal, and give in entries every other change to the list.
